{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21718","headline":"寄乐天二首 二 · 元稹","name":"寄乐天二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"论才赋命不相干，凤有文章雉有冠。\n羸骨欲销犹被刻，疮痕未没又遭弹。\n劒头已折藏须盖，丁字虽刚屈莫难。\n休学州前罗刹石，一生身敌海波澜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}